Chief Minister of Rajasthan, Shri Bhajanlal Sharma met Prime Minister, Shri Narendra Modi today in New Delhi.
In a post on X, the Prime Minister’s Office said;
“Chief Minister of Rajasthan, Shri @BhajanlalBjp met Prime Minister @narendramodi today.
@RajCMO”
